{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026esEG8Ijkib1793578933.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>吉利汽車上月新車銷量按年及按月均錄得升幅。</p><p></p><p>集團10月新車銷量31萬輛，按年上升百分之1，按月升幅逾百分之6。當中出口量10.7萬輛，按年增長1.5倍。</p><p></p><p>累計今年首10個月，銷量254萬輛，按年增長百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:40:53.776816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T00:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:40.238882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:13.969865+00:00","content_hash":"5699be1821991c6e18c9f8ce50efa2b7c214cc024bba6a9eb1453065a1b9882e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}